    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to the Arena!</strong><br>A fast paced 2D top-down arena shooter, choose your weapon from a selection of 6 each unique weapons and battle out with up to 6 players in diverse maps to choose from, in a game that is all about your skills. Compete against each other for leaderboard domination, and see who comes out to the top.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/64ac59778c6b0dee845f8d970c23efeb.avif?t=1739999312\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intense &amp; fast-paced multiplayer action:<br> All players move fast, choose the right weapon against your enemy.<br><br></li><li> Have we warned you that this game is hard?<br> 6 Deadly weapons to choose from:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/af205ce85f1110d1168fb1771d320002.poster.avif?t=1739999312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/af205ce85f1110d1168fb1771d320002.webm?t=1739999312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Matches of up to 6 players for a chaotic and unpredictable gameplay:<br> {Screenshot of players with different cosmetics}<br></li><li>Leaderboards for competitive play<br></li><li>Easy to pick on but hard to master:<br> We warn you, this game may look cute, but good luck surviving in the arena!<br> Master the weapons to win.<br></li><li>Cosmetics:<br> Yeah!, ShootEm has variety of Heroes, hats and pets to choose from!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/a28c9901ee1faf37569870efdf44322e.poster.avif?t=1739999312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/a28c9901ee1faf37569870efdf44322e.webm?t=1739999312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327700/extras/a28c9901ee1faf37569870efdf44322e.mp4?t=1739999312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gather your friends and compete to see who will become the top player in SHOOTEM battle arena!<br><br>* ShootEm made primarily for friends group to play but can be playable solo in public matches.",
